{"id":"n77207-3-12","stage":4,"title":"중계 · 现场直播","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77207-3-12-1","ko":"오늘따라 맥주집에 사람이 많네.","zh":"今天啤酒馆里人真多啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"맥주집에","meaning":"啤酒；家，店","explanation":"맥주：啤酒；집：家，店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"맥주","audio":"/audio/87234064f9ef0d6fd8db.mp3"},{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30216","senseId":"1","lemma":"맥주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"7","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맥주집에","audio":"/audio/c0c4fe0e6eed121e907f.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"많네.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많네","audio":"/audio/ef735989a6c05600e96b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"87234064f9ef0d6f","term":"맥주","zh":"啤酒","audio":"/audio/87234064f9ef0d6fd8db.mp3","entryId":"30216","definition":"主要以发酵的大麦添加水和苦味以及碳酸而制作的发泡酒。","pronunciation":["맥쭈"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，店","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"表示“销售商品的店铺”或“营业的店铺”。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f84537a0cf33cf7189ad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77207-3-12-2","ko":"오늘 저녁에 월드컵 결승전 중계가 있거든.","zh":"因为今晚有世界杯决赛的转播呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁에","audio":"/audio/adc9d30ae9de01c054e6.mp3"}},{"text":"월드컵","meaning":"世界杯","explanation":"월드컵：世界杯。","readings":[{"term":"월드컵","audio":"/audio/d0bd7c9c7885ea24880f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69987","senseId":"1","lemma":"월드컵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"월드컵","audio":"/audio/d0bd7c9c7885ea24880f.mp3"}},{"text":"결승전","meaning":"决赛","explanation":"결승전：决赛。","readings":[{"term":"결승전","audio":"/audio/c2cec1bf7ff0a6007734.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31472","senseId":"1","lemma":"결승전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결승전","audio":"/audio/c2cec1bf7ff0a6007734.mp3"}},{"text":"중계가","meaning":"现场直播","explanation":"중계：现场直播；가：主格助词，标记主语。",